{"4660070": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Destructor2D", "steam_appid": 4660070, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.poster.avif?t=1780387695\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.webm?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.mp4?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.poster.avif?t=1780387695\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.webm?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.mp4?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructor2D is a 2D racing sim with advanced physics, including car deformations. The game has various modes such as highway driving, demolition derby, crash racing, professional racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your favorite mode or follow story mode with races &amp; special events waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >advanced soft-body physics, car deformations, smoke &amp; particle effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >racing with up to 50 cars on track, with advanced AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >event types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  highway driving - drive your favorite car on a multi-lane highway with traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  crash racing - race &amp; crash, with no rules, all means to win are allowed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  professional racing - race with racing cars on a professional international circuits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  demolition derby - crash &amp; destroy other cars or be destroyed, on a special arena</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12+ race tracks, and a highway map, demolition arena</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32+ vehicles:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  trucks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  road cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  off road cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  sports cars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  race cars</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >drifting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty settings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D graphics in a 3D world (2.5D)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >low PC hardware requirements, runs on old computers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >play with keyboard or game controller</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.poster.avif?t=1780387695\" width=610 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.webm?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/9aaf7fc5abe2daeaa45825b986ad8b5d.mp4?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.poster.avif?t=1780387695\" width=610 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.webm?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4660070/extras/52e84da081b042cbd168cba81fa23738.mp4?t=1780387695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destructor2D is a 2D racing sim with advanced physics, including car deformations. The game has various modes such as highway driving, demolition derby, crash racing, professional racing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play your favorite mode or follow story mode with races &amp; special events waiting for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >advanced soft-body physics, car deformations, smoke &amp; particle effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >racing with up to 50 cars on track, with advanced AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >event types:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  highway driving - drive your favorite car on a multi-lane highway with traffic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  crash racing - race &amp; crash, with no rules, all means to win are allowed!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >